           </div>
           <ul className="space-y-1">
              <li className="text-[11px] text-gray-300 font-bold">• 10% TDS will be deducted from your amount.</li>
              <li className="text-[11px] text-gray-300 font-bold">• Conversion Rate: 10 Coins = 1 ₹</li>
